      "skos:prefLabel": "Outpost",
      "skos:definition": "An advanced square, usually on the opponent's half of the board, where a piece (most often a knight) can be planted because no enemy pawn can attack it; ideally the square is also protected by a friendly pawn and cannot easily be contested by an enemy minor piece.",
